      "status": "affected",
      "action_statement": "Update postgresql-17 to 17.12-0 or later.",
      "status_notes": "PostgreSQL fixed CVE-2026-116326 (plperl uses a stale sigjmp_buf when a tied Perl object, or one whose overloaded conversion throws, raises an exception while plperl handles another error) in 17.12 on the 17 branch: https://www.postgresql.org/support/security/CVE-2026-116326/. Checked every published build of this owner on amd64 and arm64: the server binary in 17.12-0 and in the build of Debian's 17.12-0+deb13u1 reports PostgreSQL 17.12, which contains the fix; the earlier builds, 17.11-1 and the build of Debian's 17.11-0+deb13u1, report PostgreSQL 17.11. plperl is shipped in the postgresql-plperl-17 package of the builds of Debian's 17.11-0+deb13u1 and 17.12-0+deb13u1; the 17.11-1 and 17.12-0 packages do not include plperl, so 17.11-1 reads as affected by its version only, and the build of Debian's 17.11-0+deb13u1 is affected."
    },
